  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "建築設計(二)",
    "sub_ename": "ARCHITECTURAL DESIGN(2)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程為建築基本設計之進階，進一步探討建築設計的基本設計元素與原理。尤其著重將概念的發展探討延伸至機能的分析應用上。課程的成果主要在於將機能、文化與環境能以理性、知性、感性的全方位思維整合於建築設計上。",
    "describe_eh": "This is the second semester course in architectural design. The aim of the course is to advance the basic design elements and principles in architectural design. Also the design approach starts from conceptual exploring to functional study application. The result of the course is to advance the architectural design in its totality aspect of function, culture and environment, as well as think and create rationally, intellectually and sensationally.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 4.0
